/target
node_modules
dist
.claude/settings.local.json
tmp/
docs/roadmaps/
docs/plans/
docs/handoff/
docs/reviews/

# The harness trees are TRACKED. kendex carries packages that exist in no
# marketplace — app-deploy, kendex-issues, the repo skills — and their renders
# have to survive a clone. `kendex refresh` regenerates them; the links into
# .agents/skills are relative, so they resolve in any checkout. The one row
# this posture still needs is the install ledger at the bottom, which
# `kendex refresh` writes here itself.
.env.local

# The linear skill's local cache. Bare, not `.cache/`. A trailing-slash
# pattern matches a real directory but not a symlink pointing at one, and
# every worktree links this path (WORKTREE_SYMLINKS).
.cache

# Filled-in local working copies of docs (backed up privately, never committed).
docs/*-local.md

# kendex: this machine's install ledger — the .agents trees and the
# links into them are committed, so a clone works without kendex.
/.kendex-lock.json
